noPhotos

Alias 	MyDp	D+
Alias	MyDm	D-
Alias   MyKs    K_S0

Decay pbarpSystem0
  0.5 	MyDp D-	PHSP;
  0.5   D+ MyDm PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay pbarpSystem
  0.5 	MyDp D-	PHSP;
  0.5   D+ MyDm PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay MyDp
  1.0  MyKs pi+ pi0		PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay MyDm
  1.0 	MyKs pi- pi0		PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay MyKs
  1.0   pi+ pi-					PHSP;
Enddecay

End
